OL,3,GNEWSAFamily to meet minister about
OL,4,Abrain cancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family is calling for increased
OL,7,Finvestment in brain cancer research
OL,8,Fafter the death of their teenage son.
OL,10,FMax Hall, 14, from Corby, was diagnosed
OL,11,Fwith an "incurable" brain tumour last
OL,12,Fyear and died in August.
OL,14,FHis family will meet the health
OL,15,Fminister for rare diseases, James
OL,16,FFrith, in Westminster on Wednesday, to
OL,17,Fdiscuss commitments on annual funding
OL,18,Ffor research as well as targets to
OL,19,Fensure rare tumours receive the same
OL,20,Fattention as other cancers.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
